Spec: Follow join

Purpose:
  The undecided join: one anchor per pass of the road through it, each pass fit and the settling. Part of the follow tracker.

Owns:
  ./follow_join.dart

References:
  ./follow_tracker.sdd
  /docs/specs/history/18-follow-reverse.md

Must:
  Only `60` m either side of the join passes are searched while undecided.
  Hits within `4` m, or within `15` m on a pass running the other way, count as the same road.
  The join settles on the average position while the rider stays within `8` m of it.
